# The reviewed-algorithm anchor byte-compares every POLICY_CODE_REPO_PATHS
# entry against its committed Git blob.  Canonicalize lane text to LF both in
# the index and in the working tree so Git for Windows produces those exact
# bytes even when core.autocrlf=true.  TPR-CCR5-001 also changes every
# nonempty policy blob once, forcing an existing clean worktree to
# re-materialize the files during its ordinary fast-forward.
* text eol=lf
